From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:20:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] feat(mobile): add Rex's Merino theme as a mobile palette

The desktops import Merino (Rex's default theme) from merino.t3theme.json
in t3code-customize. Mobile only renders registered palettes, so it now
ships the same file as a theme card next to Claude, Merino Dark with
Merino Light as its light variant. Like Claude it stays mobile-only, so
the id remains free for a desktop's imported copy.
